WEBVTT

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.001
BUCK: Mmm...
好吧，哺乳动物们，我们在这休息一晚

00:00:12.085 --> 00:00:14.170
Okay, mammals.
Let's stop here for the night.
好吧，哺乳动物们，我们在这休息一晚

00:00:14.254 --> 00:00:17.924
Stop? What about the whole
end of the world collision thing?
休息？那让世界末日的撞击怎么办？

00:00:18.007 --> 00:00:20.009
Oh, asteroid's still a day off.
行星还要过一天才撞地球

00:00:20.093 --> 00:00:22.637
And like my grandfather used to say,
就像我爷爷常说的…

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.640
"Red sky at night, sailor's delight.
“夜晚红霞漫天，士兵欢喜连连

00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:28.852
"Purple sky at night,
who moved my foot cream?
“夜晚紫色弥漫，谁动了我的擦脚霜？

00:00:28.935 --> 00:00:30.979
"I need my foot cream."
“我需要擦脚霜”

00:00:31.062 --> 00:00:33.606
Grampy was a confused and angry weasel.
我爷爷是个糊涂、脾气大的黄鼠狼

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:36.651
-(Julian and Diego laughing)
-DIEGO: You are so funny, J.
你太有趣了，朱

00:00:37.735 --> 00:00:39.195
Stop! You're funny.
别说了！你才有趣

00:00:39.279 --> 00:00:41.781
Take it easy, my brother
from a tiger mother.
再见，异种兄弟

00:00:41.865 --> 00:00:44.159
(both laughing)
明天见，朱朱

00:00:44.242 --> 00:00:46.119
Hasta manana, J-man.
明天见，朱朱

00:00:46.744 --> 00:00:48.163
What was that?
怎么回事？

00:00:48.246 --> 00:00:49.455
What was what?
什么怎么回事？

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:53.293
Oh, that! It's a cool way to peace out.
哦，那个！
很酷的再见方式，朱利安教我的

00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.544
Julian taught it to me.
哦，那个！
很酷的再见方式，朱利安教我的

00:00:54.627 --> 00:00:57.005
Well, I'm glad the apocalypse
is bringing you together.
我很高兴，天启把你们变亲近了

00:00:57.088 --> 00:00:59.632
He's a good kid, Manny.
I like his philosophy.
他是个好孩子，曼尼
我喜欢他的人生哲学

00:00:59.716 --> 00:01:01.593
Give him a chance. Bond with him.
给他次机会，和他交往下

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:03.845
♪ So light 'em up, up, up ♪
点燃它们，点，点，点燃它们，点，点

00:01:03.928 --> 00:01:05.305
♪ Light 'em up, up, up ♪
点燃它们，点，点，点燃它们，点，点

00:01:05.388 --> 00:01:09.184
♪ Light 'em up, up, up
I'm on fire ♪
点燃它们，点，点，我在燃烧

00:01:09.726 --> 00:01:12.395
-(groans)
-Bonding! That's a good idea!
交往！那是个好办法！

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:15.148
Oh, right. Got you.
对啊，懂你

00:01:15.231 --> 00:01:18.276
You take Julian. I got an idea for Peaches.
你去找朱利安，我有办法对付桃子

00:01:19.611 --> 00:01:21.196
(humming)

00:01:21.279 --> 00:01:23.489
Hey, Bro-Kid.
嘿，孩子兄弟

00:01:23.573 --> 00:01:25.867
Oh, hey, Bro-Dad. You here to rock out?
嘿，岳父兄弟，你来唱歌的吗？

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.535
(mimicking drumming)

00:01:27.619 --> 00:01:29.120
Okay. Instead of that...
好吧，这个就算了…

00:01:29.913 --> 00:01:31.831
How about a game before bedtime?
睡前来个比赛怎么样？

00:01:31.915 --> 00:01:35.543
No way! You want to play
a game with me? Wow!
不是吧！你想和我比赛？哇！

00:01:35.627 --> 00:01:38.421
What is honored times 1,000?
一千倍的荣幸要怎么讲？

00:01:38.504 --> 00:01:40.089
No! Times one million?
不对！一百万倍的要怎么讲？

00:01:40.173 --> 00:01:43.843
'Cause whatever that equals,
is how honored I am.
不管那等于什么，那都是我的荣幸值

00:01:43.927 --> 00:01:46.095
So, is that a "yes"?
所以，你是答应了？

00:01:46.179 --> 00:01:48.890
Yes, that's a "yes." It's the most "yes"!
没错，答应了，答应得没边儿了！

00:01:48.973 --> 00:01:50.850
It's like "yes" with a bunch of s's,
就好像有好多“应”在后面…

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:54.229
so it's like "yessssssssssssssssssss."
所以是“答应应应应应应应应”

00:01:54.312 --> 00:01:55.605
Great!
很好！

00:01:55.688 --> 00:01:57.774
-(grunting)
-I'll see you on the ice!
冰上见！

00:01:57.857 --> 00:01:58.858
(chuckles)

00:02:01.611 --> 00:02:02.654
Happy?
开心吗？

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:05.698
Whoa!

00:02:05.782 --> 00:02:06.783
(grunting)

00:02:10.828 --> 00:02:12.038
Oh, boy.
哦，天哪

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:16.709
(clears throat)

00:02:19.963 --> 00:02:22.757
So, do you think you're ready
to go out roaming on your own?
你觉得你做好独自旅行的准备了吗？

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:25.051
I won't be alone. I'll have Julian.
我不是一个人，还有朱利安

00:02:25.134 --> 00:02:27.762
Sure. But with asteroids flying,
当然，可有那个行星在飞…

00:02:27.845 --> 00:02:29.222
no home to speak of
没有家而言，更别说没人支持…

00:02:29.305 --> 00:02:31.307
and absolutely no support system,
没有家而言，更别说没人支持…

00:02:31.391 --> 00:02:32.934
do you think you'll be ready for...
你觉得你准备好应付…

00:02:33.017 --> 00:02:34.060
This?
这个了吗？

00:02:34.143 --> 00:02:35.436
(gasping)
我是个小宝宝

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.605
I'm a wittle baby.
我是个小宝宝

00:02:37.689 --> 00:02:38.773
(bawling)
想象一下，你在树林里觅食…

00:02:38.856 --> 00:02:41.317
Imagine. You're in the woods,
looking for food
想象一下，你在树林里觅食…

00:02:41.401 --> 00:02:43.778
and your baby gets sick. What do you do?
你的孩子生病了，你怎么办？

00:02:43.861 --> 00:02:44.988
Uh...
不对！摇晃会让她更难受！

00:02:45.071 --> 00:02:47.198
No! Jiggling makes her feel worse!
不对！摇晃会让她更难受！

00:02:47.991 --> 00:02:48.992
(vocalizing)

00:02:49.075 --> 00:02:50.451
(screams)

00:02:50.535 --> 00:02:51.953
(bawling)
哦，不！你的小孩膝盖破了，鼻子不通气

00:02:52.036 --> 00:02:53.788
Oh, no! Now your older toddler
哦，不！你的小孩膝盖破了，鼻子不通气

00:02:53.871 --> 00:02:56.374
has a skinned knee and a stuffy nose.
哦，不！你的小孩膝盖破了，鼻子不通气

00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:58.251
Mommy, hold me!
妈妈，抱我！

00:02:58.334 --> 00:02:59.794
Now your babies are crying.
你的孩子哭了

00:02:59.877 --> 00:03:01.796
You have no food and then
你没有吃的，对面还来了只疯癫的怪物！

00:03:01.879 --> 00:03:04.590
you come face to face with a rabid beast!
你没有吃的，对面还来了只疯癫的怪物！

00:03:04.674 --> 00:03:06.301
(growling)
我是只疯癫的怪物，要把病传染给娃娃

00:03:06.384 --> 00:03:10.847
I am a rabid beast
who gives rabies to babies.
我是只疯癫的怪物，要把病传染给娃娃

00:03:11.222 --> 00:03:12.473
(yelling)
还有潜逃的纵火犯

00:03:12.557 --> 00:03:14.809
And there's an arsonist on the loose.
还有潜逃的纵火犯

00:03:14.892 --> 00:03:15.893
(cackling)

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:20.773
(screaming)
没人帮忙，你怎么处理这些？

00:03:20.857 --> 00:03:23.276
How are you going to handle
all this without our help?
没人帮忙，你怎么处理这些？

00:03:23.359 --> 00:03:24.610
(both bawling)

00:03:25.361 --> 00:03:26.321
(gasps)

00:03:26.404 --> 00:03:27.405
(screaming)

00:03:27.947 --> 00:03:28.948
(cackling)

00:03:33.411 --> 00:03:35.288
-Huh?
-Ah!

00:03:37.874 --> 00:03:38.875
(crying)

00:03:40.251 --> 00:03:42.545
-Ah!
-(bawling)

00:03:43.254 --> 00:03:44.589
Peaches, out!
桃子，赢了！

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.720
Well, that's just the easy stuff.
这只是最简单的

00:03:50.803 --> 00:03:53.139
There's a lot more we still need to cover.
还有更多的事要应对

00:03:54.599 --> 00:03:57.185
Uh... Baby made a poopie.
宝宝拉粑粑了

00:03:57.268 --> 00:04:01.898
(spits) I'm a method actor,
so I will need to be changed.
我是实战派的演员，所以我要换尿片

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.692
JULIAN: Oh! So close!
就差一点！

00:04:04.776 --> 00:04:06.861
These pucks go fast.
这些冰球的速度好快

00:04:06.944 --> 00:04:09.822
Just watch the puck
all the way into the stick.
盯好球，一直到它碰到杆

00:04:13.618 --> 00:04:15.244
Oh! I did it!
我成功了！

00:04:15.328 --> 00:04:17.497
Too bad you and Peaches are moving away.
真是糟糕，你和桃子要搬走

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.874
If you stayed, we could do this all the time.
留下来的话，就能一直玩了

00:04:19.957 --> 00:04:22.543
Okay. Show me the heat!
好吧，兴奋起来！

00:04:22.627 --> 00:04:24.462
I'm like a hockey ninja!
我就像个冰球忍者！

00:04:27.673 --> 00:04:29.092
Hey, Peaches!
嘿，桃子！

00:04:29.175 --> 00:04:31.010
Looks like you got a new hockey partner
你有个新的冰球伙伴，能代替你爸爸了

00:04:31.094 --> 00:04:32.553
to replace your dad.
你有个新的冰球伙伴，能代替你爸爸了

00:04:32.637 --> 00:04:33.971
(grunting)

00:04:36.516 --> 00:04:37.767
(groaning)

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:38.935
Oh!
哦，不

00:04:39.018 --> 00:04:40.353
Oh, no.
哦，不

00:04:44.524 --> 00:04:45.900
Julian!
朱利安！

00:04:46.234 --> 00:04:47.276
(shivering)

00:04:48.986 --> 00:04:51.406
Such a mystery why
he wants to move far away.
他要搬远一点的原因真是难以看透啊

00:04:51.489 --> 00:04:52.907
I didn't mean to do it.
我不是故意的

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:55.201
It's not my fault the kid has no reflexes.
那孩子不懂条件反射，不能怪我

00:04:55.284 --> 00:04:56.577
PEACHES: How could you do that to him?
你怎么可以这么对他？

00:04:56.661 --> 00:04:58.079
I thought you liked Julian.
我以为你喜欢朱利安

00:04:58.162 --> 00:04:59.205
I do like Julian.
我是喜欢他

00:04:59.288 --> 00:05:00.581
Well, you don't act like it.
可你言行不一致

00:05:00.665 --> 00:05:03.126
When you look at him,
all you see is an obstacle.
你看着他，就只觉得他是个绊脚石

00:05:03.209 --> 00:05:04.919
Or worse, a target.
可能更糟，一个攻击的对象

00:05:05.002 --> 00:05:06.921
But I see a sweet guy
可我看到一个善良的家伙…

00:05:07.004 --> 00:05:09.966
who's trying his hardest to impress you.
在努力给你留下好印象

00:05:10.049 --> 00:05:12.218
-Peaches.
-No! Both of you, just stop!
–桃子
–不！你们俩收手吧！

00:05:12.301 --> 00:05:14.137
If we survive, I'm still getting married
如果我们渡过这一关
我还是要结婚，离开家

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.596
and I'm still leaving home.
如果我们渡过这一关
我还是要结婚，离开家

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.015
Whether you're happy for me or not.
不论你们为我开心还是不开心

00:05:21.227 --> 00:05:23.271
Don't give me that look. She said both.
别用这种眼神看我，她说的是咱俩

00:05:23.354 --> 00:05:25.189
That means you, too.
也包括你

00:05:27.525 --> 00:05:29.277
And this widdle astewoid
这个小行星呜呜呜呜，一直哭回家

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.654
went wee, wee, wee, all the way home.
这个小行星呜呜呜呜，一直哭回家

00:05:31.737 --> 00:05:32.989
(dino-birds gasp)

00:05:33.072 --> 00:05:34.532
ROGER: Hey... (yelps)

00:05:35.575 --> 00:05:36.617
Eh...
因为爸爸和他的朋友拯救了世界

00:05:36.701 --> 00:05:40.329
Because Daddy and his fwiends
saved the world.
因为爸爸和他的朋友拯救了世界

